// Minimal board fixtures for this batch's apply/ cases: an empty tableau
// and foundations (init_piles), a fresh selection (ui_init), and one card
// already sitting in the waste so src_bottom (which always reads the waste
// top first, even for a tableau source) never indexes an empty list. The card is 0, or 8 for the
// false-path cases of the found_* functions, which never matches foundation 0's next-card rule.
apply_board_setup(int ab_card) {
  init_piles();
  ui_init();
  push((import waste), ab_card);
} return void;
(0):() then calls init_piles:[1]
(0):() then len((import waste)):(1)
(8):() then len((import waste)):(1)
(8):() then calls init_piles:[1]
